  "title": "EU–Mercosur: Beyond trade in a fragmented global order",
  "summary": "The report released by the Spanish Institute for Strategic Studies, authored by Ramón Casilda Béjar, examines the EU–Mercosur Association Agreement from an economic, geopolitical and strategic perspective. The report argues that the agreement goes far beyond trade by representing a commitment to multilateralism, European strategic autonomy, and the creation of a shared economic and political space amid growing global competition between the US and China.",
